meta {
  name: Payu Notify
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/payu/notify
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  ~OpenPayU-Signature: REPLACE_WITH_VALID_PROVIDER_SIGNATURE
}

docs {
**Access:** Public (no token)

**Signature:** needs a valid `OpenPayU-Signature` header — generate via the provider sandbox (`stripe listen` / PayU sandbox); it can't be hand-forged.

**Responses:** 200
}
